  "contentText": "부 칙(2001. 8. 16 교학11502-288)\n1. 본 학칙에서 규정하지 아니한 사항은 총장이 따로 정한다.\n2. 이 규정은 공포한 날로부터 시행한다.\n3. (경과조치) ① 2000학년도 및 2001학년도 학생은 종전의 재적학과를 적용 받는다. 다만, 휴학 및 복학생(2000학년 및 2001학년도)은 아래와 같이 종전 재적학과에서 변경된 통합 학부의 재적생으로 본다, 전공은 학생이 선택할 수 있도록 한다.\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;border:none;table-layout:fixed;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n\t<td rowspan=\"2\" valign=\"middle\" style=\"overflow:hidden;width:202px;height:34px;border-left: #000000 1.134000pt solid;border-right: #000000 0.425250pt solid;border-top: #000000 1.134000pt solid;border-bottom: #000000 1.417500pt double;padding:1.4pt 1.4pt 1.4pt 1.4pt\">\n\t<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:80%;\"><span style=\"position:relative;font-family:&quot;굴림&quot;;font-weight:bold\">종 전 재 적 학 과</span><span class=\"hnc_page_break\" style=\"display:relative;word-spacing:-0.5em;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\t</td>\n\t<td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"middle\" style=\"overflow:hidden;width:411px;height:17px;border-left: #000000 0.425250pt solid;border-right: #000000 1.134000pt solid;border-top: #000000 1.134000pt solid;border-bottom: #000000 0.425250pt solid;padding:1.4pt 1.4pt 1.4pt 1.4pt\">\n\t<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:80%;\"><span style=\"position:relative;font-family:&quot;굴림&quot;;font-weight:bold\">변경된 재적학부(과) 및 전공</span><span class=\"hnc_page_break\" style=\"display:relative;word-spacing:-0.5em;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\t</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n\t<td valign=\"middle\" style=\"overflow:hidden;width:183px;height:17px;border-left: #000000 0.425250pt solid;border-right: #000000 0.425250pt solid;border-top: #000000 0.425250pt solid;border-bottom: #000000 1.417500pt double;padding:1.4pt 1.4pt 1.4pt 1.4pt\">\n\t<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:80%;\"><span style=\"position:relative;font-family:&quot;굴림&quot;;font-weight:bold\">학부(과)</span><span class=\"hnc_page_break\" style=\"display:relative;word-spacing:-0.5em;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\t</td>\n\t<td valign=\"middle\" style=\"overflow:hidden;width:228px;height:17px;border-left: #000000 0.425250pt solid;border-right: #000000 1.134000pt solid;border-top: #000000 0.425250pt solid;border-bottom: #000000 1.417500pt double;padding:1.4pt 1.4pt 1.4pt 1.4pt\">\n\t<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:80%;\"><span style=\"position:relative;font-family:&quot;굴림&quot;;font-weight:bold\">전&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 공</span><span class=\"hnc_page_break\" style=\"display:relative;word-spacing:-0.5em;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\t</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n\t<td valign=\"middle\" style=\"overflow:hidden;width:202px;height:41px;border-left: #000000 1.134000pt solid;border-right: #000000 0.425250pt solid;border-top: #000000 1.417500pt double;border-bottom: #000000 0.425250pt solid;padding:1.4pt 1.4pt 1.4pt 1.4pt\">\n\t<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"margin-left:10.0pt;margin-right:10.0pt;text-align:left;line-height:80%;\"><span style=\"position:relative;font-family:&quot;굴림&quot;\">조 형 미 술 학 과</span><span class=\"hnc_page_break\" style=\"display:relative;word-spacing:-0.5em;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\t</td>\n\t<td valign=\"middle\" style=\"overflow:hidden;width:183px;height:41px;border-left: #000000 0.425250pt solid;border-right: #000000 0.425250pt solid;border-top: #000000 1.417500pt double;border-bottom: #000000 0.425250pt solid;padding:1.4pt 1.4pt 1.4pt 1.4pt\">\n\t<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"margin-left:15.0pt;margin-right:15.0pt;text-align:left;line-height:80%;\"><span style=\"position:relative;font-family:&quot;굴림&quot;\">미 술 학 부</span><span class=\"hnc_page_break\" style=\"display:relative;word-spacing:-0.5em;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\t</td>\n\t<td valign=\"middle\" style=\"overflow:hidden;width:228px;height:41px;border-left: #000000 0.425250pt solid;border-right: #000000 1.134000pt solid;border-top: #000000 1.417500pt double;border-bottom: #000000 0.425250pt solid;padding:1.4pt 1.4pt 1.4pt 